#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "About ICQ"
msgstr "O ICQ programu"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tutorial will help you to use ICQ, a common chat protocol in &kopete;."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj tutorijal će vam pomoći da koristite ICQ, chat protokol u &kopete;."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.icq.com/en.html\">ICQ</ulink> is a proprietary "
"instant messaging program, first developed by the Israeli company Mirabilis. "
"It uses AOL's OSCAR network protocol for sending the text messages. To "
"identify people, it uses a number, called UIN (Unified Identification "
"Number). If you register an ICQ account, you also have to enter an e-mail "
"address. Some ICQ clients support login with that e-mail address instead of "
"your UIN (but not &kopete;)."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.icq.com/en.html\">ICQ</ulink> je vlasnički program "
"za slanje istovremenih poruka, kojeg je razvila izraelska kompanija "
"Mirabilis. On koristi AOL-ov OSCAR mrežni protokol za slanje tekstualnih "
"poruka. Da bi identifikovao osobe, on koristi broj, kojeg nazivamo UIN. Pri "
"registraciji ICQ korisničkog računa, također trebate da unesete Vašu e-mail "
"adresu. Pojedini ICQ korisnici podržavaju prijavu pomoću date e-mail adrese, "
"umjesto prijave sa vašim UIN-om (but not &kopete;)."

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Osobine"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
