msgstr "Offline poruke"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "multi user chat"
msgstr "grupni chat"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "file transfer"
msgstr "prijenos podataka"

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features not yet supported by Kopete"
msgstr "Osobine koje Kopete još uvijek ne podržava"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "games"
msgstr "igre"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "sending SMS"
msgstr "slanje SMS poruke je u toku"

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Criticism"
msgstr "Kritika"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Privacy: according to the security analyst Jeffrey Carr, the russian secret "
"service could gain access to chat protocols. For further information see "
"<ulink url=\"http://greylogic.us/2010/07/13/your-icq-identity-now-belongs-to-"
"the-fsb/\">here</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Privatnost: po sigurnosnom analitičaru Jeffrey Carru, ruska tajna služba bi "
"mogla pristupiti chat protokolima. Više informacija možete pronaći na <ulink "
"url=\"http://greylogic.us/2010/07/13/your-icq-identity-now-belongs-to-the-"
"fsb/\">here</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Spam: there is a lot of spam (unwanted advertisement or viruses) in the ICQ "
"network"
msgstr "Neželjena pošta: postoji mnogo neželjene pošte u ICQ mreži"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copyright: according to the <ulink url=\"http://www.icq.com/legal/policy.html"
"\">ICQ Acceptable Use Policy</ulink>, you allow ICQ to use posted material "
"in any manner they want"
msgstr ""
"Autorska prava: prema <ulink url=\"http://www.icq.com/legal/policy.html"
"\">ICQ Politika Prihvatljivog Korištenja</ulink>, dopuštate da ICQ koristi "
"postavljene materijale na bilo koji način to žele"

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create your ICQ account"
msgstr "Kreirajte svoj ICQ korisnički račun"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before you can chat via ICQ, you have to create an ICQ account. If you "
"already have one, you can skip this page."
msgstr ""
"Prije nego što možete da razgovarate putem ICQ-a, morate da kreirate ICQ "
"korisnički račun. Ako ga već posjedujete, možete preskočiti ovu stranicu."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to the registration page with your preferred web browser (&eg; "
"<guilabel>Firefox</guilabel>, <guilabel>Konqueror</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Chromium</guilabel>) <ulink url=\"https://www.icq.com/register/"
"\">www.icq.com/register</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Idite na stranicu za registraciju, koristeći Vaš preferirani web preglednik "
"(&eg; <guilabel>Firefox</guilabel>, <guilabel>Konqueror</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Chromium</guilabel>) <ulink url=\"https://www.icq.com/register/"
"\">www.icq.com/register</ulink>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Enter you data</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Unesite Vaše podatke</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Enter you data</para>"
msgstr "<para>Unesite Vaše podatke</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have to wait until you get an e-mail from ICQ, which contains your "
"verification link."
msgstr ""
"Sada morate da pričekate dok ne dobijete e-mail od ICQ-a, koji sadrži Vaš "
"verifikacioni link."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>click on the verification link in your e-mail to verify you "
"registration</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>kliknite na verifikacioni link u vašem e-mailu, kako biste potvrdili "
"Vašu registraciju</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<para>click on the verification link in your e-mail to verify you "
"registration</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>kliknite na verifikacioni link u vašem e-mailu, kako biste potvrdili "
"Vašu registraciju</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have your ICQ account! But at the moment, you can only login with "
"Kopete using UINs (Unified Identification Number). ICQ does not show you "
"your UIN by default. You have to go with your browser to <ulink url="
"\"https://www.icq.com/people\">www.icq.com/people</ulink> and login there."
msgstr ""
"Sada imate Vaš ICQ korisnički račun! Međutim, u ovom momentu možete da se "
"prijavite sa Kopete koristeći isključivo UIN brojeve. ICQ Vam neće prikazati "
"Vaš UIN broj po defaultu. Trebate da putem Vašeg web preglednika odete na "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.icq.com/people\">www.icq.com/people</ulink> i tamo "
"se prijavite."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>login on www.icq.com</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>prijavite se putem www.icq.com</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>login on www.icq.com</para>"
msgstr "<para>prijavite se putem www.icq.com</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Then you have to go to your profile:"
msgstr "Zatim morate otići na svoj profil:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>click on My Profile</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>klikni na Moj Profil</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>click on My Profile</para>"
msgstr "<para>klikni na Moj Profil</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you will get an information page about your account. If you click on "
"<quote>More about me</quote> you will see an entry called ICQ#. This is your "
"UIN:"
msgstr ""
"Sada ćete dobiti informacijsku stranicu o vašem korisničkom računu. Ako "
"kliknete na <quote>Više o meni</quote> vidjećete unos ICQ#. Ovo je Vaš UIN:"

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connect through Kopete"
msgstr "Povežite se putem Kopete"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first time, you start &kopete;, you will see a window like this:"
msgstr "Kada prvi put pokrenete &kopete;, vidjećete prozor poput ovog:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Kopete on the first startup</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kopete pri prvom pokretanju</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Kopete on the first startup</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kopirate pri prvom pokretanju</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add your ICQ account click on <guilabel>Click to add an account</"
"guilabel>. Or if you have already entered another account (like MSN or "
"Jabber) you go to menu <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and click on "
"<guilabel>Add Account</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodali Vaš ICQ korisnički račun, kliknite na <guilabel>Klikni da "
"dodaš korisnički račun</guilabel>. Ako ste već ušli na drugi korisnički "
"račun (npr. MSN ili Jabber), idite na meni <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> i kliknite na "
"<guilabel>Dodaj Korisnički Račun</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you see a list of all chat protocols available for &kopete;. In this "
"case, as you want to use ICQ, you have to choose the ICQ entry:"
msgstr ""
"Sada vidite listu svih chat protokola dostupnih u &kopete;. U ovom slučaju, "
"ako želite koristiti ICQ, trebate odabrati ICQ prijavu:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Choose your protocol</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izaberite svoj protokol</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Choose your protocol</para>"
msgstr "<para>Izaberite svoj protokol</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you see the configure dialog for your account. Click on <guilabel>Basic "
"Setup</guilabel> above in the tab bar. There you have to enter your UIN. If "
"you don't want to enter your password every startup, you can add your "
"password, too."
msgstr ""
"Sada vidite konfiguracijski dijalog za Vaš korisnički račun. Kliknite na "
"<guilabel>Osnovno Postavljanje</guilabel> iznad trake sa karticama. Tu "
"trebate unijeti Vaš UIN. Ako ne želite da unosite Vašu šifru pri svakom "
"pokretanju, možete je dodati."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Basic account setup</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Osnovne postavke korisničkog računa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Basic account setup</para>"
msgstr "<para>Osnovne postavke korisničkog računa</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Account Preferences</guilabel> tab contains more detailed "
"settings:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Preference korisničkog računa</guilabel> kartica sadrži detaljnije "
"postavke:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>More settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Više postavki</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>More settings</para>"
msgstr "<para>Više postavki</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kopete; should work without changing any settings here. So if you don't "
"understand points mentioned below, don't panic, just skip this section."
msgstr ""
"&kopete; bi trebao da radi bez promjene ikakvih postavki. Ako ne razumijete "
"tačke navedene ispod, ne paničite, samo preskočite ovaj dio."

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options explained"
msgstr "Objašnjene opcije"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Require authorization before someone can add you to their contact "
"list:</guilabel> Choose this option if you want to be asked before someone "
"else can add you to his buddy list. Normally, everyone can search you and "
"add you to his list. This means every stranger you don't even know can see "
"whether you are online or not or can send you messages. If you don't want "
"this, you can check this options and afterwards you will be asked if you "
"want to confirm someone before he can chat with you."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zahtijevajte dozvolu prije nego što vas neko može dodate na "
"njihovu listu kontakata:</guilabel> Izaberite ovu opciju ako želite biti "
"pitani prije nego što Vas neko može dodati na svoju listu prijatelja. Inače, "
"svako može da Vas potraži i doda Vas na svoju listu prijatelja. To znači da "
"svaki stranac, neko kog čak ni ne poznajete,  može vidjeti da li ste online "
"ili ne i može Vam slati poruke. Ako to ne želite, može te odabrati ove "
"opcije i nakon toga ćete biti pitani da li želite da prihvatite nekoga prije "
"nego što može da razgovara sa Vama."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Hide IP address:</guilabel> If you don't want others to see your "
"<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IP_address\">IP</ulink>, you can "
"check this option. The IP address is an ID to identify you in the Internet. "
"This number is unique. An average Internet user cannot get your name out of "
"your IP Address, only your provider can do this! ICQ saves your IP address "
"anyway for a specific time. So it is no real privacy problem not to choose "
"this option."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sakrij IP adresu:</guilabel> Ako ne želite da drugi vide "
"vašu<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IP_address\">IP</ulink>,možete "
"odabrati ovu opciju. IP adresa je ID kojim ste identifikovani na Internetu. "
"Ovaj broj je unikatan. Prosječan internet korisnik ne može dobiti Vaše ime "
"iz Vaše IP adrese, samo vaš provajder to može da uradi!  ICQ svakako spašava "
"Vašu IP adresu na određeno vrijeme, tako da ne postoji stvaran problem "
"privatnosti ako ne odaberete ovu opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Make my status available via ICQ's unified messaging center:</"
"guilabel> If you choose this option, your status will be published on the "
"messaging center (visible for everyone at www.icq.com/people)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Učini moj status vidljivim preko ICQ-evog ujedinjenog sjedišta za "
"razmjenu poruka:</guilabel> Ako odaberete ovu opciju, Vaš status će biti "
"objavljen na sjedištu za razmjenu poruka:  (vidljiv svima na www.icq.com/"
"people)."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Override default server information:</guilabel> If you want to "
"modify the address where &kopete; log in to the ICQ network, this option "
"makes it possible (normally you won't need this setting)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable Proxy:</guilabel> connect through a <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Proxy_server\">Proxy server</ulink>. Proxy servers are "
"servers that transfer requests. Some companies, schools and universities use "
"these servers to deny access to some websites. Users connecting from their "
"home won't need this setting."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Omogući Proxy:</guilabel> poveži kroz<ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Proxy_server\">Proxy server</ulink>. Proxy serveri su "
"serveri koji prenose zahtjeve. Neke kompanije, škole i univerziteti koriste "
"te servere da zabrane pristup nekim web-stranicama. Korisnicima koji se "
"povezuju iz svog doma neće trebati ova postavka."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Port Range:</guilabel> This option tells &kopete; which ports "
"should be used for peer to peer connection. Further explanations of the "
"function of ports would go too far here. If you want more information take a "
"look at the <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_numbers"
"\">Wikipedia article</ulink>. Normally you won't get any problems with the "
"default settings."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Opseg Portova:</guilabel> Ova opcija govori &kopete; koji portovi "
"bi trebali biti korišteni za peer to peer konekciju. Daljnja objašnjenja o "
"funkciji portova bi ovdje otišla predaleko. Ako želite više informacija, "
"možete ih dobiti na  <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_numbers"
"\">Wikipedia članku</ulink>. U normalnim okolnostima nećete imati nikakvih "
"problema sa defaultnim postavkama."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Timeout:</guilabel> defines, how many seconds &kopete; should wait "
"before it drops connection. For example you send a file to one of your "
"contacts but your contact's Internet connection is troubled so he does not "
"get the file. This option tells &kopete; how long it should try to send the "
"file. Normally you don't have to change this."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Timeout:</guilabel> definiše, koliko bi sekundi &kopete; trebao "
"pričekati prije nego prekine konekciju. Recimo da pošaljete neku datoteku "
"nekom od svojih kontakata, međutim, njegova Internet konekcija nije u redu, "
"tako da on nije primio tu datoteku. Ova opcija govori &kopete; koliko dugo "
"treba da pokušava poslati datoteku. Inače, ovo ne morate da mijenjate."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Default encoding:</guilabel> sets the encoding of the messages. "
"Windows users will use the <quote>windows-125*</quote> (windows-1250 to "
"windows-1258) encoding, so if you are going to chat with windows users, "
"choose this option. And even if you only talk to persons not using windows "
"it is likely that they will also use the windows-125* setting (because they "
"perhaps chat with people using windows). The different windows encodings are "
"for different countries. Choose the most fitting one (for example the "
"<quote>Windows-1252 Western</quote> for countries like France or Germany). "
"The difference between these encodings are only some special characters,so "
"if they are not displayed correctly, try another."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zadano kodiranje:</guilabel> postavlja kodiranje poruka. Windows "
"korisnici će koristiti<quote>windows-125*</quote> (windows-1250 do "
"windows-1258) kodiranje, tako da, ako želite da razgovarate sa Windows "
"korisnicima, odaberite ovu opciju. Čak i ako isključivo razgovarata sa "
"osobama koje ne koriste Windows, vrlo je vjerovatno da će i oni koristiti  "
"windows-125*  postavku(zato što možda razgovaraju sa osobama koje koriste "
"Windows). Različita Windows kodiranja su za različite zemlje. Izaberite ono "
"najprikladnije (na primjer, <quote>Windows-1252 zapadnoevropski</quote> za "
"zemlje poput Francuske ili Njemačke). Razlika između ovih kodiranja jesu "
"samo specijalni znakovi, tako da ako nisu pravilno prikazani, probajte neki "
"drugi."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have successfully configured your ICQ account. You can click on "
"<guilabel>Next</guilabel> and <guilabel>Finish</guilabel>. If you have more "
"than one account, you can choose different colors for them, so you can "
"easily see which contacts come from which account."
msgstr ""
"Sada ste uspješno konfigurisali Vaš ICQ korisnički račun. Možete kliknuti na "
"<guilabel>Sljedeće</guilabel> i <guilabel>Završi</guilabel>. Ako posjedujete "
"više korisničkih računa, možete odabrati različite boje za njih, tako da "
"možete lako da vidite koji se kontakti nalaze na kom korisničkom računu."

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add a contact"
msgstr "Dodajte kontakt"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have connected &kopete; and your account. The window should look "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"Sada ste spojili &kopete; i vaš korisnički račun. Prozor bi trebao izgledati "
"ovako:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Connected</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Povezano</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Connected</para>"
msgstr "<para>Povezano</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a contact press <guilabel>Add</guilabel> in the toolbar and choose "
"your account (in this case it is your UIN), or you can use the menu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Add Contact</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem><replaceable>your account</replaceable></"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. There you can enter the UIN of the person you "
"want to add."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste dodali kontakt pritisnite <guilabel>Dodaj</guilabel> na alatnoj "
"traci i odaberite Vaš korisnički račun (u ovom slučaju je to Vaš UIN), ili "
"možete da koristite meni <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Dodaj kontakt</guisubmenu><guimenuitem><replaceable>Vaš "
"korisnički račun</replaceable></guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Tu možete unijeti "
"UIN osobe koju želite da dodate."

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not know the UIN, but perhaps the nickname or the e-mail address "
"of a person, it is also possible to search for your contact. Click on the "
"<guilabel>Search</guilabel> button."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne znate UIN, ali znate nadimak ili e-mail adresu neke osobe, također je "
"moguće vršiti pronalaženje kontakta. Kliknite na <guilabel>Pretraži </"
"guilabel> dugme."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>It is also possible to search UINs</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Moguće je pretraživati UIN brojeve</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>It is also possible to search UINs</para>"
msgstr "<para>Moguće je pretraživati UIN brojeve</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Being added"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you use ICQ, it is very likely that you will get added by someone else. "
"If this happens, &kopete; will display a message which contains the UIN of "
"the person who wants to add you to his list."
msgstr ""
"Ako koristite ICQ, vrlo je vjerovatno da ćete biti dodani od strane nekog "
"drugog. Ako se to desi, &kopete; će prikazati poruku koja sadrži UIN osobe "
"koja želi da Vas doda na svoju listu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>authorization request</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>zahtjev za autorizaciju</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>authorization request</para>"
msgstr "<para>zahtjev za autorizaciju</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get more information about the person click on <guilabel>Info...</"
"guilabel>. A window will open which contains all the information available "
"about the person."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dobili više informacija o osobi kliknite na <guilabel>Info...</"
"guilabel>. Otvoriće se prozor koji sadrži sve dostupne informacije o toj "
"osobi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Information</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Informacija</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Information</para>"
msgstr "<para>Informacija</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can authorize or block the person. If you authorize, you can chat "
"with him and vice versa, if you block him, he can't talk with you."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete odobriti ili blokirati osobu. Ako odobrite, možete razgovarati "
"sa njom i obrnuto, a ako je blokirate, ona ne može razgovarati sa vama."

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chatting"
msgstr "Razgovaranje"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To chat, click on one of your contacts. A chat window will appear. There you "
"can type your text and send it."
msgstr ""
"Da biste razgovarali, kliknite na jednog od Vaših kontakata. Pojaviće se "
"prozor za razgovor. Tu možete otkucati Vaš tekst i poslati ga."

#. Tag: phrase
#: icq.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Chat with your contacts</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Razgovarajte sa svojim kontaktima</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Chat with your contacts</para>"
msgstr "<para>Razgovarajte sa svojim kontaktima</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is also possible to send messages to persons that are offline. They will "
"receive your message as soon as they go online."
msgstr ""
"Također je moguće slati poruke osobama koje su trenutno offline. One će "
"primiti Vašu poruku čim budu online."

#. Tag: title
#: icq.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spam"
msgstr "Neželjena pošta"

#. Tag: para
#: icq.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sadly, there is a lot of spam (spam are messages you don't want, usually "
"advertisement or viruses) on the ICQ network. To avoid spam, you should "
"authorize only people you know. There is nothing you can really do about "
"this problem. Just ignore them!"
msgstr ""
"Nažalost, postoji mnogo neželjene pošte (to su poruke koje ne želite, obično "
"reklame ili virusi) na ICQ mreži. Da biste izbjegli neželjenu poštu, trebate "
"odobriti samo osobe koje poznajete. Ne postoji ništa što biste mogli uraditi "
"u vezi sa ovim problemom. Samo ih ignorišite!"
